      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of a cervical cord compression by the vertebral artery within the spinal canal is reported in a 47-year-old man. The clinical presentation, radiologic features, and the operative treatment are summarized. The mechanism by which this lesion caused a severe cervical pain is discussed."},
